    "body": "Close, but a couple of things first.\n\nThis breaks the round trip: `dumps(loads(x))` has to give back `x` exactly, and sorting here changes the key order the user wrote. Please keep the original order.\n\nNeeds a test before it can go in.\n\nnit: naming, please use snake_case (`(remove it)`).",
